WEBVTT

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.660
Madam, your meal has been prepared.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.350
I'm not hungry.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.860
Understood.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:04.460
Rea has?

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.580
Yes.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.900
She has been asked to be the class representative in the debate.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.250
I see...

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.260
After all, she's a flawless young lady who excels at both academics and sports.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.010
Okay.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.730
"Flawless", you say?

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.480
Hm?

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.270
Oh, yes.

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:37.820
A student who's escorted to school gates by a boy is "flawless"?

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.660
She's the chairman's daughter, so something like that...

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.160
As it is, if we don't deal with it, won't we be setting a bad example?

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.130
Yes, but I was instructed not to interfere with the young lady's life...

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.920
It's because she's our daughter.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.550
My husband doesn't want her to receive special treatment.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.050
Suspension.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.800
I wouldn't go as far as expulsion.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.310
Reprimand, warnings, there are many ways to do this.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:07.690
Then with that being said, I will give her a stern warning.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.520
Be sure to impose a proper penalty.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.020
That's an order.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.280
Understood.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.370
Satsuki.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.040
Yes?

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:29.790
Want to have a drink too?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.130
I'm on duty, so I will refrain.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:34.500
It's fine, just drink.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:35.960
Mistress...

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:40.640
I know you are making fun of me by acting like that.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.390
Mistress, if you drink any more, it will affect your health.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.310
Shut up!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.520
Mistress, would you like to rest?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.900
You really look down on me, huh?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.240
Unbelievable.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:06.330
All of them are making fun of me.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.120
Hey, can't we stop watching this?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.880
But why?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.510
This is the good part!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.840
Well, it's not very well made.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.010
On the other hand, "The Devil Stirs" is a masterpiece.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.680
Let us at least finish it.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.230
Are you not interested?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.810
Nothing important happens after this part.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.020
Nii!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.560
Mero?

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.270
What's wrong?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.780
Nii, please come down!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.870
What was she doing under the temple...

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.330
It is a mystery.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.830
And what's with her outfit?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.320
It is most peculiar.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.920
I wonder how old she is.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.170
About twelve or thirteen, I guess.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.720
She's pretty, isn't she?

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.180
Huh?

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.550
Don't you think so?

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.430
I'm not really into that...

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:13.970
Huh?

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.270
Into what?

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.980
Nii, Rea-dono won't understand if you're that subtle about it.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.150
Then how should I say it?

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.900
Hey, be quiet.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.530
'tou-chan.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.570
Officer Edogawa will be here shortly.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.870
I believe she's lost child or something.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.410
I'd be relieved if that's true.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.420
If she was abandoned by her parents or something...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.420
Could you just tell me your name?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.130
How about your address or what grade you're in?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.430
What happened?!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.440
When we told her we were taking her to the hospital, she suddenly...

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.230
Why?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.440
Come on, there's nothing to be afraid of.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.650
You're fine, just calm down!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.490
No!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.540
It's impossible to take her to the hospital like this.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:17.410
Yeah.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.620
I'll have a doctor come here.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.630
You guys are closer to her age,

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.000
perhaps she'll talk to you.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.340
Could you give it a try?

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.760
Sure.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.760
Can you not talk?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.850
Do you not want to talk?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.730
Is there something you're unhappy with?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.770
This is troubling.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.770
Nothing will come from this.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.280
Nii, are you joking around?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.370
No, I thought I could open her heart...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.580
Was it actually funny?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.460
Say, why don't we watch a movie together?

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.710
Zombie movies are really fun!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:11.510
Rea-dono, you should give up on that.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.510
Why?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.680
I'm sure she'll like it.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.140
I don't think that's very likely...

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:18.680
Is that so?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.390
I think they're fun.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:23.520
Even I wouldn't have come up with that idea...

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.650
Rea-dono's air-headedness always soothes me.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.570
Is that so?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.410
Where's the doctor?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.670
He left.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.000
"In the end, she never said anything", he said.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.040
For the time being, it seems like we'll be looking after her.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:52.840
In addition to Rea-dono, she'll really make it lively around here.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.380
Oh yeah, can I help with anything?

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:59.050
Well then, could you take that girl her dinner?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:08:59.810
Ah!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:05.330
I brought you dinner.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.560
I'm coming in.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:10.570
Huh?

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.210
Rea!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.660
Hey, what happened!?

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.470
Rea-dono, are you all right?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.470
Furuya-kun... Mero-chan...

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.480
I'm sorry, my foot slipped.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.980
Honestly, what are you doing?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.650
I'm sorry.

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:53.980
Are you really okay?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.050
Ah, yes.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.080
Good morning!

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.390
Oh, morning.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.950
Ah, Rea-dono,

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.620
how are you feeling?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.050
I'm totally fine!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.350
Aside from that, did something happen?

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:15.610
We can't find Rea-chan's hydrangea leaf.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:16.130
Huh?

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:19.890
I was sure it was left in this plastic container, but...

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.840
It's fine.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.390
I'll pick another one from the back garden.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.930
That's terrible.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.430
Maybe it was an animal.

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:36.150
Whatever you do, be careful.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.650
I'll get you a leaf from the mountain out back.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.890
Thank you.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:52.670
If you want seconds, feel free to ask for as much as you want.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.430
I-Indeed.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.760
Indeed!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:06.640
Since it's like this, you don't hold back.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.890
She's a normal girl after all.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:15.330
I wonder if she'll open her heart more if we hit Jii-chan.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:19.090
Hey now, even as a joke, you shouldn't say things like that.

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:21.360
I'm fine with that.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.360
Otou-san.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.370
Eh...

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.620
Aren't you just over thinking things, Rea-chan?

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.250
Maybe I am.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.760
I mean, you found her just yesterday.

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.770
She shouldn't have a grudge or anything.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.160
I suppose that is right, but...

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.550
It's just your imagination.

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.800
I hope that is the case.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.200
I don't think that girl has any desire to hurt you.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.640
She's probably afraid of you.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:51.980
Of me?

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.380
She's a kid, isn't she?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.100
She can't be honest enough to say she's afraid.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.970
That's why she's being so cold to you.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.490
Is that what it is?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.170
It is!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.410
Why don't you try approaching her, Rea-chan?

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.910
If you do, her attitude will change.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.410
Okay.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.920
Can I come in?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.320
I'm coming in.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.660
Are you feeling better?

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:32.100
I do not know the circumstances,

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.600
but I am sure you would be happy to meet your family soon.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.640
Do you hate me?

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:43.830
Or have I done something to hurt your feelings?

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:46.070
If I did, please tell me.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:49.240
I am really dense about these kinds of things.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:54.260
I am sorry I bothered you while you were resting.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:56.240
Well then, I will talk to you again later.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.760
That was nerve racking.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.270
Furuya-kun!

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.110
What is it?

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.720
About that girl, what do you think?

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:21.360
What do you mean?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.260
I was wondering what you think about her.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.280
Me?

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.280
I feel bad for her.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.780
I see.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:32.040
What?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.830
It is nothing.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:38.040
What was that about?

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:44.300
I wonder if she really is afraid of me.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:33.310
Hey.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.320
What are you thinking,

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.320
doing something like that to Furuya-kun.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.200
You were the one that destroyed the hydrangeas,

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.200
and pushed me down the stairs, were you not?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.440
It does not matter if you hate me,

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.200
but stop doing things to Furuya-kun.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.540
If you do not do anything else,

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.700
I will not tell anyone about what you've done so far.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.060
Please.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.020
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.320
Okay, shall we get going?

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.060
Yes.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.220
Did you sleep well last night?

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.490
Yeah, why?

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.300
No reason.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.630
If you did, that is good.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.620
I'm back.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.080
Welcome back.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.580
Rea-chan, do you have a moment?

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:40.750
O-Oh, yes.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:52.780
Even if you don't say it clearly, we can understand you if you nod or shake your head.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.600
Can I ask you what I asked you earlier once again?

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.320
Did somebody hit you?

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.830
Who hit you?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:14.810
Rea-chan, it's not like I believe what she said, either.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:18.430
However, it's still true that she said it.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.900
I understand.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:23.610
I don't think she'd say something like that without reason.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.000
Do you have any ideas?

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:31.020
I don't.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.190
That's enough!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:55.410
What is it?

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.210
What happened?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.110
She tried to kiss Furuya-kun!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:07.190
Kiss?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:11.410
Rea-dono, perhaps you were mistaken in what you saw?

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:12.300
It's true!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.750
Rea-chan, don't make such a scary face.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.090
She's scared.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.760
It's an act!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.060
You shouldn't say things like that.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.310
Oji-sama!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.600
She tried to kiss me.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.350
Huh?

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.230
What Rea said is true.

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.760
There's something strange about her.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.430
No matter how you think about it, she's no ordinary kid.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.870
Furuya-kun...

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:38.240
Is it true?

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.740
Damn it!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.950
Wait!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.420
What are you doing?

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.800
Did you forget?

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.350
What are you saying?

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.760
As usual, you prefer this girl.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.310
What do you mean?

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.200
You're so dense.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.010
You still can't tell?

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.820
Okaa-sama.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:21.210
Even though I thought I'd take everything...

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:24.330
In the end, it turns out that everyone around you is stupid.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:28.030
They should have obediently done as I wanted,

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:30.330
but it was all, "Rea, Rea, Rea"!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:33.570
Everyone only cared about Rea.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.200
Nobody cared about me.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:38.590
What, you're Rea's mum?

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:42.990
You're just some brat who can't love people so you obsess over a zombie!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.600
When are you going to grow up?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.250
You're saying that again?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.350
You're the one who won't grow up.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:50.850
What?

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:57.140
It's only natural that a person like you, who does nothing but make shady deals, would be hated.

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:58.810
You should realise that already.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.360
That's why you're alone.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.370
If you're that lonely, should I give you a hug?

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.890
Who'd do something like that?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:16.060
If you were reborn with a zombie body and a pure heart, I might do it though.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:23.470
What, are you trying to start a psychic battle?

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.740
Ow, is she serious?

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:34.560
Furuya-kun!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.390
A dream?

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.260
A bad dream.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.900
A hallucination?

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.650
I'm sorry.

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:27.680
I'm not hungry today either.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.660
U-Understood.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.540
About the matter of the young lady's punishment,

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:45.550
how does two weeks worth of volunteer work, and preventing her from attending the debate sound?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:50.730
Regarding the problem, there are several teachers who have complaints,

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:53.170
and among the students, the young lady is quite popular.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.060
You can stop.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:55.060
Huh?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.230
I changed my mind.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:03.070
I stopped caring about going against my husband's wish and punishing her.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.820
Is that so?

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:18.790
Something wrong?

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:19.700
No.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:23.390
I just saw my mother's car, that's all.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.180
Did she say something to you today?!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.520
N-No, nothing today.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:28.430
I see.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:31.300
I wonder if my lecture worked.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:31.930
Huh?

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.180
What do you mean by that?

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.010
I had a dream last night.

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:41.190
A girl collapsed at the temple, and somehow it was your mother.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:48.760
Anyway, she started her usual harassment, saying something like "someone like you"...

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:49.740
What's wrong?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:50.530
Oh?

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:51.870
Is that so?

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:57.530
Thank you, Furuya-kun.

00:21:57.530 --> 00:22:00.260
Oh, you're welcome.
